{"term": {"label": "心", "occurrences": 7, "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "4B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/li-lou-ii", "title": "離婁下", "description": "孟子曰：「舜生於諸馮，遷於負夏，卒於鳴條，東夷之人也。文王生於岐周，卒於畢郢，西夷之人也。地之相去也，千有餘里；世之相後也，千有餘歲。得志行乎中國，若合符節。先聖後聖，其揆一也。」\n子產聽鄭國之政，以其乘輿濟人於溱洧。孟子曰：「惠而不知為政。歲十一月徒杠成，十二月輿梁成，民未病涉也。君子平其政，行辟人可也。焉得人人而濟"}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "下", "id": "下"}, {"form": "人", "id": "人"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君", "id": "君"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "思", "id": "思"}, {"form": "服", "id": "服"}, {"form": "王", "id": "王"}, {"form": "異", "id": "異"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "臣", "id": "臣"}, {"form": "視", "id": "視"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.7362210780689065, "source": "視", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 3.054674809187441, "source": "視", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 1.550597412411167, "source": "視", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.550597412411167, "source": "視", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "君子", "target": "心"}, {"weight": 1.4170660197866443, "source": "君子", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 0.8574502318512216, "source": "君子", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "心", "target": "君"}, {"weight": 1.4170660197866443, "source": "心", "target": "臣"}, {"weight": 0.5520685823000399, "source": "心", "target": "人"}, {"weight": 1.2992829841302609, "source": "心", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "心", "target": "子"}, {"weight": 1.2992829841302609, "source": "心", "target": "下"}, {"weight": 1.550597412411167, "source": "心", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "心", "target": "服"}, {"weight": 1.7047480922384253, "source": "心", "target": "王"}, {"weight": 2.1102132003465894, "source": "心", "target": "異"}, {"weight": 1.550597412411167, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0986122886681098, "source": "心", "target": "禮